{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1000_null", "source_sha256": "73d5ba892baddd04b3c2850be8f7c0642a4e0cd87850bc9c7c07c16690d46dc1", "ja": "『竜宮小町』デビューライブ終了後……", "zh": "“龙宫小町”出道演唱会结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "1d3bf996483e7144a83f2c2c445f7dbdcd33693eecb0227762b8ee7cdd1d40cf", "ja": "ところで、{$P$}殿。\n人を背後からそっと見守るの、やめてもらえませんか。", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}先生。\n能不能别从背后悄悄盯着人看了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3cd5dd08a1d48f791821791901ce65c3cc82526b8afebd45e2fef2d269143b96", "ja": "気づいてたのか……。いや、感慨にふけってるところ、\n邪魔したら悪いと思って。", "zh": "原来你发现了啊……不，我只是觉得，在你沉浸感慨的时候打扰你不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "786fef1ff3905380ffd60399d841c6f4eecf10c6507b40996a5aaea2b5194ecc", "ja": "お気遣いどーも。でも、足音が近づいてきて\n背後で止まったら、普通気がつきますからね？", "zh": "多谢你的关心。不过，脚步声靠近后在背后停下来了，正常都会察觉到的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "1ed722b0cc11fbe39b6c3deaea3190770e3b930ac6ecb3a4bc97292389f00510", "ja": "それで、どうしたんですか？\n私になにか用事でも？", "zh": "那么，您找我有什么事吗？\n是有什么事要找我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c3a900d87e34c47d3b1dd7174a12cd2bc2c665948e31ce27c19823529ec17774", "ja": "用事というか、ただの挨拶だよ。\nライブ公演のプロデュース、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "与其说是有事，不如说只是来打个招呼。\n这次现场演出的制作工作，真的辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "d3a0ef105da0b2994c6150d94d935ecbfae45843b4ca41c881bfa880eccc540b", "ja": "え？　それをわざわざ言いに来てくれたんですか？\nさっきもライブが終わってすぐ、言ってくれたのに。", "zh": "咦？你特意过来就是为了说这个吗？\n刚才演出一结束，你不是也马上说过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0433b9fc4878f43f750e90ea3eba7dcbf6c3dd09bf4649d9e86ff60ecdc9124f", "ja": "さっきは、アイドルの律子に言ったんだ。\nプロデューサーの律子には、言ってなかったから。", "zh": "刚才是对作为偶像的律子说的。\n因为还没对作为制作人的律子说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "837d91d4813557981a91bcd2ab53dba30f8270fa1de3b3ede2c59dc7c9de1b14", "ja": "プロデューサーの……なるほど。\nふふっ、はい、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "制作人的……原来如此。\n呵呵，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "5ad2379147f9f90a04f64cadb000d6697fddbd236e78d9d27accd109701c788e", "ja": "本当、なんとかなるもんですね。\nじつは、あんまり自信なかったんですけど。", "zh": "真的，总会有办法的呢。\n其实，我原本也没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "b94aaa0d82b87328e6c30400980ee026e61697817736556a10c7e8e9a0c2035d", "ja": "アイドルとプロデューサーの兼任。\n途中で音を上げる自分が、容易に想像できたというか。", "zh": "同时兼任偶像和制作人。  \n我很容易就能想象出自己做到一半喊苦喊累的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0e97894c4e1809939f0a32fecda020ecfdf2d056111510a7e643762d1c7dc216", "ja": "まあ、愚痴や泣き言は出るだろうと思ってたよ。\nでも結局はやり遂げる、とも思ってた。", "zh": "我本来就觉得，你肯定会抱怨、诉苦什么的。\n但我也觉得，你最后还是会坚持完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "497fb75ebc85d43bab35d9b8321dcdade742014a1be78c7e6de769698b4659be", "ja": "あはは。褒められたんだか、貶されたんだか……。\nま、いいですけど。", "zh": "啊哈哈。真不知道您这是在夸我，还是在损我……\n不过，也无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "6ac7fc23d6b9ff9046ea3456f6711439eb61ff474904f5631e0e187d4a5139da", "ja": "とにかく、そういうことなら私も、\nあらためて挨拶させてもらいますね。", "zh": "总之，既然是这样，那我也重新向您问候一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0433_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "14f081a8f64d66c2ca02d7d4be717e869d541c09ea5b3c21f8e5cdea4e3a1439", "ja": "これからは、アイドルとしても同僚としても。\nよろしくお願いしますね、{$P$}！", "zh": "今后无论是作为偶像，还是作为同事，都请多多关照，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
